       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CARTPROG.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-ITEM.
          05 WS-NAME PIC X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM ADD-PARA.
           CALL 'STORESUB' USING WS-TOTAL.
           STOP RUN.
       ADD-PARA.
           ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL.
       COPY CUSTREC.
